<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal C/A deficit widens to 647 bln esc Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Portugal C/A deficit widens to 647 bln esc Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal had an accumulated current account deficit of 647.4 billion escudos between January and October compared with a deficit of 506.2 billion in the same period of 1995, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>			 Jan-Oct 96   Jan-Oct 95	Oct 96   Oct 95</p>
<p>    C/A balance	 -647.4	-506.2	   -51.6    -70.2</p>
<p>    Goods	     -1,446.4    -1,451.6	  -146.5   -140.5</p>
<p>    Services	    +125.2	+172.9	   +17.9    +22.7</p>
<p>Foreign investment</p>
<p>    in Portugal	 +913.6	 +60.7	   -83.5   -221.8</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
